      "items": [
        "Launch Date: 1 April 2020",
        "Goal: Boost manufacturing to 25% of GDP, reduce imports, create jobs, and strengthen \"Make in",
        "India.\"",
        "Key Points:",
        " Incentives: 4-6% on incremental sales for 5-7 years.",
        " Sectors (14): Textiles, Steel, Food Processing, IT Hardware, Pharmaceuticals, Batteries,",
        "Electronics, Solar Modules, White Goods, Automobiles, Appliances, Telecom, Medical Devices,",
        "and Drones."
      ]
